  "details": "I noticed an increased usage of VRAM. In my Home world Live vs. Beta ~500MB more VRAM usage. VRAM usage is higher than normal in every other world too. Some of my friends already confirmed that they noticed similar behavior.\n\nRecorded on\n* 2022.2.2p5-1231-828ef2d146-Release (first half) 1.360.216K/162.568K (Dedicated/Shared)\n* 2022.3.1-1238-9050a39ff5-Release (second half) 1.878.208K/164.692K  (Dedicated/Shared)\n\nhttps://youtu.be/IQRiemlC6Ig",
